                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Pharmacy Benefit Managers (PBMs) are preventing reasonably priced drugs from being available to the American people and charging Medicare artificially high prices.\n\nWatch my remarks in the @HouseCommerce Health Subcommittee where I outline how just two drugs are costing Medicare MILLIONS. \u2b07\ufe0f\u2b07\ufe0f",
