                "text": "Thank you to representatives of the @FAIA_Florida for stopping by to talk about renewing the Tax Cuts & Jobs Act, protecting essential services to small businesses around Florida, and protecting food security in America through renewing crop insurance policies in the Farm Bill. https://t.co/F9tauhk62f",
