                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicaid is a vital lifeline for our nation\u2019s most vulnerable. Unfortunately, Democrats have put the program\u2019s future into jeopardy by allowing able-bodied adults without dependents, illegal immigrants, and deceased beneficiaries to remain on Medicaid rolls.\n\nI\u2019m proud to stand with my GOP colleagues on @HouseCommerce to preserve Medicaid benefits for those who need them.",
